        stateTitle: "Finance AI is moving from drafting to controlled execution.", stateCopy: "Modern finance teams combine spreadsheet copilots, document intelligence, anomaly detection, forecasting, and close automation. High-value adoption depends on traceable calculations and separation between generation, review, and approval.", statePoints: ["AI can accelerate unstructured-document extraction and narrative reporting.", "Predictive models and copilots support forecasts, but assumptions and data lineage must remain visible.", "Confidentiality, segregation of duties, model risk, and audit evidence are non-negotiable."],
