          ["Automation and delivery intelligence", "Design a workflow that gathers signals, detects exceptions, and prepares action without silently changing commitments.", ["Meeting-to-action and issue-triage workflows", "Portfolio and dependency summaries", "Human approvals, access, and escalation"], "Prototype an automated delivery pulse from project inputs to stakeholder update."],
          ["Prototype, validate, and present", "Use AI-assisted prototyping to test assumptions, then create a credible execution and measurement plan.", ["Rapid prototype and usability scenario", "Prioritization and success metrics", "Roadmap trade-offs and executive narrative"], "Present an AI-supported delivery system with evidence, prototype, plan, and controls."]
